    #
    # + headers - Headers to be sent with the request 
    # + payload - The invoice ID and the Time / Expenses / FixedAmounts filter sections (at least one required). SendWebhooks is ignored 
    # + return - Returns the computed line items and totals. An empty LineItems list means nothing is currently ready to bill for the filters 
